Tables created from the Medicare Part B Fee-For-Service National Summary Data
(formerly BESS) from 2000-2024. The 2009-2024 files are the modern CMS
releases and contain all HCPCS codes nationwide. The 2000-2008 files were
assembled from the per-code-range CSVs on the original CMS BESS annual CDs
(retrieved from archived copies of the CMS download pages) and cover the full
surgery section, HCPCS 10040-69990, which includes every rhinology code
analyzed here. The analysis notebooks filter to the 19 rhinology codes of
interest.
